<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><meta charset="utf-8"><title>黑金四头蛇 · 骨骼苏醒</title>
<style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#100c12;color:#e9d2a1;font:14px system-ui,'Microsoft YaHei'}main{max-width:1550px;margin:auto;padding:16px}h1{font-size:21px;margin:0 0 12px}section{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 300px;gap:16px}canvas{width:100%;background:#160c17;border:1px solid #715830}aside{background:#201722;padding:15px;border-radius:8px}button,select,input{accent-color:#d8ac5e}button{background:#3d2c29;color:#ffdf98;border:1px solid #7c6040;border-radius:4px;padding:7px 12px;cursor:pointer}label{display:block;margin:9px 0}input[type=number]{width:64px;color:#ffe3af;background:#18121b;border:1px solid #725536;padding:4px}input[type=range]{width:100%}fieldset{border:1px solid #634d36;margin:12px 0;padding:9px}p{line-height:1.7;color:#c4b4a3}small{color:#bca987}.controls{margin-top:12px}#clock{float:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}#status{min-height:28px}@media(max-width:900px){section{grid-template-columns:1fr}} </style>
<main><h1>黑金四头蛇 · 独立骨骼苏醒</h1><section><div><canvas id="stage" width="1536" height="1024"></canvas><div class="controls"><button id="play">暂停</button> <button id="replay">从头播放</button> <button id="end">完成姿势</button><span id="clock"></span><input id="seek" type="range" min="0" max="25" step="0.0166667" value="0"><div id="status"></div></div></div><aside>
<label><input id="bones" type="checkbox"> 显示骨骼及连接</label><label><input id="idle" type="checkbox" checked> 抬起后独立微动</label><label><input id="scene" type="checkbox" checked> 显示床与共享盘身</label><label>播放速度 <select id="speed"><option value="0.25">0.25×</option><option value="0.5">0.5×</option><option selected value="1">1×</option><option value="2">2×</option></select></label>
<div id="parts"></div><button id="export">导出时机 JSON</button> <button id="load">导入</button><input hidden type="file" id="file" accept=".json">
<p>四个头各有完整头颈、独立骨骼和睁闭眼素材。到位后睁眼，之后保持睁眼。取消其他图层可单独检查。</p><small>默认 1 / 5.5 / 12 / 17 秒开始；20 秒完成。20–25 秒展示睁眼待机。调整时间不会自动保存，请导出 JSON。</small></aside></section></main>
<script>window.RIG=__RIG__;window.ASSETS=__ASSETS__;window.OFFLINE_RENDER=new URLSearchParams(location.search).has('render');</script><script>__JS__</script></html>
